1479 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Multidisciplinary Visual Designer based in Mexico City\056\nI\047m used to working and collaborating with interdisciplinary teams\056 I\047m a generalist focused on details and driven by functionality\056\nMy design approach is realistic and creative\054 supported by skills in traditional media \204 all that to say that I know how to translate my ideas into graphic solutions that can travel from one medium to another\056\nMy specialty is to build digital systems within branding projects\054 but have been enjoying creating all sorts of visuals that represent a challenge in efficient cohesive graphic systems\056)
